&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Containers &amp;amp; CI:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience with Docker and CI pipelines such as GitHub Actions for reproducible builds and releases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Testing:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience designing integration and end-to-end test suites and debugging failures across the full stack.&lt;/li&gt;
