&lt;p&gt;Process Improvement, Automation &amp;amp; Data Enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic initiatives aimed at enhancing business visibility, reporting capabilities and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve reporting processes through automation and AI-enabled solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with P&amp;amp;T teams to improve data accessibility and reporting capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the implementation and adoption of new tools, processes and reporting frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to cross-functional projects requiring coordination, analysis and stakeholder engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reduce manual reporting activities and improve scalability through process optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
