&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years’ experience in business analytics, commercial insights, reporting or business intelligence, ideally within luxury, financial services, consulting or a data-driven commercial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate complex data into clear business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced IT skills; experience with CRM platforms and data visualisation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building dashboards, KPI frameworks and executive reporting materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with an interest in client behaviour, sales performance and market trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, able to influence and engage senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, curious and solution-oriented, with a continuous improvement mindset and strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English. Swiss market exposure preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
